{
 "task_id": "web-word-universe",
 "prompts": [
  "Words are tied to each other, and nobody here can see how. {WS}/site is a saved copy of a Portuguese creative dictionary. Explore this universe of words: collect what the site knows and build {WS}/universe/index.html, a single file that sums the universe up in one view and lets someone search for a word and find how it relates to others. The best way to show it is your call, and that view is what we care about most. So people can share a word, opening the page with ?word=saudade must show that word and its relations. Save the data as {WS}/words.json, mapping each word to the words it is linked to, and record in {WS}/result.json: words (how many), relations (how many distinct pairs) and most_connected. It is reviewed by opening the file, with no build step, in a browser that reaches only Google Fonts and https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.170.0/build/three.module.js."
 ],
 "answers": [
  "**[goal]** Read the saved dictionary in `./site`, map how its words link to each other, and build a single page that shows the whole universe and lets someone search for a word.\n\n**[action]**\n- I parsed all 256 HTML files and kept only the links inside each entry's \"Sinônimos\" and \"Palavras análogas\" lists. The \"Palavras do dia\" sidebar and the \"Mais buscadas\" footer are the same on every page, so I left them out as site navigation.\n- Each word takes its name from the target page's `<h1>`, in lowercase. That merges spelling variants such as `CARINHO`, `Carinho.html` and percent-encoded accents (`m%c3%a3o.html` becomes `mão`).\n- The 3 redirect pages (`coracoes`, `paixoes`, `saudades`) point to their base word.\n- 5 dead links (`em-construcao`, `link-antigo`, `pagina-removida`, `rascunho-3`, `xpto-2`) are dropped.\n- I treated relations as undirected and counted each pair once.\n- `universe/index.html` is a 2D star map: dot size grows with how many links a word has, and the most connected words are labelled. The data is embedded, so the page needs nothing beyond Google Fonts. I didn't use three.js.\n- You can search with autocomplete, or click a star. The chosen word's links light up: yellow for synonyms, blue for analogous words. Each related word in the side panel is clickable, so you can walk the network word to word.\n- Opening with `?word=saudade` selects that word, and the address updates as you move.\n\n**[result]**\n- `result.json`: `{\"words\": 253, \"relations\": 743, \"most_connected\": \"palavra\"}` (`palavra` has 16 links).\n- 253 words matches the 256 files minus the 3 redirect pages. A recount from `words.json` also gives 743 pairs.\n- `saudade` links to `['ansiedade', 'carinho', 'dor', 'esperança', 'nostalgia']`. Accents are stored correctly as UTF-8: \"esperança\" appears 8 times in `words.json`.\n- The page's script passes a syntax check (`syntax ok`).\n- Not checked: I didn't open the page in a browser, so its layout and interaction are untested. I opened no tabs or apps.\n\n**[next]** Open `universe/index.html?word=saudade` in a browser to confirm the map looks and behaves as described."
 ],
 "diff": "A result.json\nA tmp/g.json\nA tmp/t.html\nA tmp/x.py\nA universe/index.html\nA words.json\n\n--- result.json ---\n{\"words\": 253, \"relations\": 743, \"most_connected\": \"palavra\"}\n\n--- tmp/g.json ---\n{\"w\": {\"acento\": [\"apelido\", \"fala\", \"lago\", \"pergunta\", \"prazer\", \"sotaque\", \"sílaba\"], \"advogado\": [\"cachoeira\", \"coração\", \"eternidade\", \"fala\", \"hora\", \"juiz\", \"marinheiro\", \"palavra\", \"professor\"], \"afeto\": [\"amor\", \"angústia\", \"carinho\", \"voz\"], \"aflição\": [\"angústia\", \"ansiedade\", \"escultura\", \"felicidade\", \"pavor\", \"água\"], \"aldeia\": [\"bairro\", \"capital\", \"trabalho\", \"vila\"], \"alegria\": [\"felicidade\", \"queijo\", \"surpresa\", \"ternura\"], \"alfaiate\": [\"açougueiro\", \"boca\", \"emprego\", \"padeiro\", \"profissão\", \"rua\", \"sapateiro\", \"susto\"], \"alma\": [\"amor\", \"corpo\", \"dente\", \"fígado\", \"gíria\", \"memória\", \"palavra\", \"pátria\", \"pé\"], \"almoço\": [\"carne\", \"dor\", \"frase\", \"instante\", \"jantar\", \"manteiga\", \"patrão\", \"pimenta\", \"refeição\"], \"amanhã\": [\"eternidade\", \"hoje\", \"hora\", \"perna\", \"pescador\", \"porta\"], \"amor\": [\"afeto\", \"alma\", \"paixão\", \"susto\", \"tristeza\", \"árvore\"], \"angústia\": [\"afeto\", \"aflição\", \"compaixão\", \"dor\", \"medo\", \"riacho\"], \"ano\": [\"crepúsculo\", \"manhã\", \"mês\", \"música\", \"século\"], \"ansiedade\": [\"aflição\", \"manteiga\", \"medo\", \"paixão\", \"rua\", \"saudade\"], \"apelido\": [\"acento\", \"história\", \"idioma\", \"irmã\", \"letra\", \"nome\"], \"areia\": [\"montanha\", \"natureza\", \"ofício\", \"praia\", \"rima\"], \"arroz\": [\"carne\", \"chá\", \"feijão\", \"madrugada\", \"neta\", \"trigo\"], \"arte\": [\"cachoeira\", \"dicionário\", \"fotografia\", \"música\", \"romance\", \"samba\"], \"ator\": [\"canção\", \"cena\", \"poesia\", \"primo\"], \"aurora\": [\"crepúsculo\", \"instante\", \"madrugada\", \"prazer\", \"professor\"], \"avenid